#: data/scripts/gift_altering_cave.inc:15
msgctxt "sText_MysteryGiftAlteringCave"
msgid ""
"Thank you for using the MYSTERY\n"
"GIFT System.\p"
"There appears to be a rumor about\n"
"rare POKéMON sightings.\p"
"The sightings reportedly came from\n"
"the ALTERING CAVE on ROUTE 103.\p"
"Perhaps it would be worthwhile for\n"
"you to investigate this rumor.$"
msgstr ""
"感谢你使用神秘礼物系统。\p"
"有传言说\n"
"有人目击了稀有的宝可梦。\p"
"据说目击地点是\n"
"103号道路的变幻洞窟。\p"
"也许值得你\n"
"去调查一下这个传言。$"
